        "original_id": "4fb05713-8644-5494-a895-c41819bd1fc8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Labrador Retriever, Tibetan Terrier, Mastador\n- People: Spike\n- Works: Old Yeller\n- Companies: Disney\n- Concepts: retriever-gun dog, Dokhi Apso, outdoor Apso\n\nFacts:\n- The Labrador Retriever is a type of retriever-gun dog.\n- Some old travelers' accounts refer to the Tibetan Terrier as Dokhi Apso or \"outdoor\" Apso, indicating a shaggy or bearded working dog that lives outdoors.\n- In 1957, Spike was a lop-eared yellow Mastador, a Mastiff and Labrador Retriever mix, and a dog actor best known for playing Old Yeller in Disney's film Old Yeller.",
